    rdfs:comment "TENSION (resolved for consistency): one passage enumerates content/criterion/construct/consequential/face validity as coordinate evidence categories (modeled above as AllDisjointClasses). Another passage states construct validity 'subsumes all other types of validity'. To avoid unsatisfiability, ContentValidity, CriterionValidity and FaceValidity are no longer modeled as subclasses of ConstructValidity; only ConvergentValidity and DiscriminantValidity (which are not part of the disjoint partition) remain subclasses." ;
